6-10-25T11:42:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041756","verified_at":"2026-10-25T15:21:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4772650-1846651706682890","game_id":"steam-4772650","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO v1.1.5 Updated","summary":"Main Updates:Fixed an issue where some sound effects did not turn off as expected.Optimized the function of repeatedly clearing the platform.Cleaned up some redundant files.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T19:31:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682890","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4772650-1845383656397237","game_id":"steam-4772650","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO v1.1.4 Updated","summary":"Main Updates:Fixed abnormal getting stuck caused by floating-point numbers.Fixed the valve position in Level 10; it is now fully aligned.Removed some useless information, making the package smaller.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T17:52:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397237","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4772650-1845383656389759","game_id":"steam-4772650","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO v1.1.3 Updated","summary":"Main Updates:Fixed:Fix the issue where the player may unexpectedly die in Level 5.Fix the case where it may unexpectedly remain white.Fix the situation where error prompts may have problems in some cases.Improvements:Add sound effects for time slowdown/restore (active).Add time returning to normal when switching levels.Improve the wording issue of custom key bindings.Add additional content when the demo is not perfectly cleared.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T18:47:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389759","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4772650-1845383656378740","game_id":"steam-4772650","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO v1.1.2 Updated","summary":"Main Updates:Improved the guidance for howtoplay levelImproved the guidance for 4th levelFixed a bug when click guidebook in certain situations","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T19:17:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656378740","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4772650-1845383656376488","game_id":"steam-4772650","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO v1.1.1 Updated","summary":"Main Updates:Fixed a bug where resetting and ghosting numbers could appear in certain situationsFixed a bug in level 5 that could cause unexpected deathsFixed bugs in the howtoplay levels to make them more effective for teaching","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T06:54:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656376488","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4772650-1844751498228549","game_id":"steam-4772650","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO v1.1.0 Updated","summary":"Main Updates:Improved guidance in the beginner levels by adding highlights and basic instructions.Improved guidance for incorrect actions, so you can now understand more clearly what went wrong without using Tips Mode.Improved Level 5 to prevent certain special situations from preventing its intended teaching purpose from being achieved.Removed Direction to reduce stylistic inconsistency. It will be added back in the full version.Improved the opening screen to prevent a few frames with different","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-27T05:04:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498228549","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4772650-1844751498221698","game_id":"steam-4772650","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO v1.0.2 Updated","summary":"Main Updates:Fixed:Fixed a bug that could cause ghosting when switching between pages in the guidebook too quickly.Fixed a bug that could prevent interaction with the guidebook after clicking Tutorial in the settings.Improvements:Changed the save file location to make saving easier for players.Added the ability to press Esc to exit the settings directly without using the exit button.Now reset blocks when you meet the valve.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T14:22:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221698","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:03:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4772650-1844115010490972","game_id":"steam-4772650","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO v1.0.1 Updated","summary":"Main Updates:1. Fixed a crash that occurred after entering the game content.2. Fixed the Back button not responding in the final document.3. Added a falling particle effect that changes over time as the particles fall.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T06:08:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announceme